    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers, or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Fogarty are delighted to offer this house for sale in such a wonderful location. This is the perfect place to create a family lifestyle, surrounded by a beautiful garden and yet an easy walk to the town centre. All schools, shops, bus routes and the N7 are minutes only from the front door. Opportunities to purchase a house in this location present very rarely. \nBuilt in 1999, it is a location has been loved by many over the years, and whilst requiring a new owners personal style and taste, there is a deep quality to this superb home. \nA terrific dormer bungalow that has so many possibilities, with a practical layout and generous rooms. Accommodation comprises, ground floor. An entrance hallway, a sitting room with an open fireplace, a large kitchen come dining room, a study/dining room if required, a conservatory, three double bedrooms and a family bathroom. At first floor level there are two more large bedrooms, and another bathroom. The overall floor area of the house is 196 sq. mts/ 2,110 sq. ft. and there is a useful garage space also.\nThis is a comfortable and enjoyable home, surrounded by stunning gardens extending to approx. .75 of one acre, and a wonderful purchase for the discerning buyer. \nPlease call Julie Fogarty 0505 21192."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.40m x 2.44m\n\n\nLiving Room - 5.46m x 3.67m\n\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 4.90m x 5.74m\n\n\nConservatory - 3.77m x 4.92m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.13m x 3.00m\n\n\nLobby - 1.51m x 2.35m\n\n\nBoiler house - .94m x .90m\n\n\nGarage - 2.72m x 3.00m\n\n\nShower Room - 2.35m x 3.23m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.97m x 3.91m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.93m x 2.45m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.86m x 4.05m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 3.40m x 4.00m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 6.38m x 4.43m\n\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.79m x 4.43m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.94m x 1.50m\n\n\n"
      },
